    "# COLISEUM Defender — Notebook 3: GRPO Training (In-Environment RL)\n",
    "## Aditya's Part | **HACKATHON DAY (Saturday)**\n",
    "\n",
    "**Goal:** Take the SFT checkpoint and improve it with GRPO using live environment rewards.\n",
    "The environment server (Shivam's `server.py`) must be running before this notebook starts.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Kaggle Setup:**\n",
    "- Accelerator: **GPU T4 x1**\n",
    "- Internet: ON (needs to call env server)\n",
    "- Expected runtime: ~90 minutes for 500 GRPO steps\n",
    "- Session budget: ~1.5 hours\n",
    "\n",
    "**Input:**  SFT checkpoint from `coliseum-defender-sft` HF repo\n",
    "**Output:** `coliseum-defender-grpo` checkpoint → HF Hub\n",
    "\n",
    "## Hackathon Coordination\n",
    "Before starting this notebook:\n",
    "1. ✅ Shivam confirms `server.py` is running at http://ENV_SERVER_URL\n",
    "2. ✅ Vishva confirms both attacker checkpoints are pushed to HF Hub\n",
    "3. ✅ You have the ENV_SERVER_URL and ENV_API_KEY (from Shivam)\n",
    "\n",
    "If server isn't running yet → use MOCK_ENV=True (see Cell 4) to train with simulated rewards."
   ]
